flowchart TD
    A[Define hunt hypothesis] --> B[Confirm data source and time range]
    B --> C[Run baseline SPL query]
    C --> D{Relevant events found?}
    D -- No --> E[Record no-hit result and telemetry limits]
    D -- Yes --> F[Inspect raw events and fields]
    F --> G[Correlate with supporting telemetry]
    G --> H{Evidence sufficient?}
    H -- No --> I[Document uncertainty and collect more evidence]
    H -- Yes --> J[Determine disposition]
    J --> K[Document findings and recommended actions]
